COMPILATION OF: E52WA

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52WA

   1 a 0000 E52WA: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-10 probe WA (PLAN sec P3-10 panel A): bare
   4 a 0006       SIGNAL ERROR as a standalone statement. Historical
   5 a 0006       witness: LOAN2 code 0359-035F = 21 00 00 / AF / CD
   6 a 0006       ?SIGOP (CHAIN-EXT slot 035E), 7 bytes, no jump-over,
   7 a 0006       no SP cell, next statement follows directly. Predict
   8 a 0006       H-A: same 7 bytes here; the x = 2 assignment shows
   9 a 0006       the continuation. Falsifiers: MVI A,00 for AF; any
  10 a 0006       extra helper or jump; a relocation on the LXI operand. */
  11 a 0006 
  12 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  13 c 0006 
  14 c 0006    signal error;
  15 c 000D    x = 2;
  16 c 0013 
  17 a 0013 end E52WA;

CODE SIZE = 0016
DATA AREA = 0002
FREE SYMS = 38D1
END  COMPILATION
